# Build context excludes: keep the image small and keep local state out of it.
# A stray adaptive.db copied into the image would ship one machine's tenants and
# API-key digests to every deployment, and a local adaptive.yaml would bake one
# machine's database path and worker count into every deployment. Mount the config
# at runtime (or point ADAPTIVE_CONFIG at it) instead.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
adaptive.yaml
.git
.github
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
tests/
examples/
*.md
!README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
